# A clover used from the inventory (fixtures/clover: the outside save
# with 20 life points, byte 264, and the CD's LBA.CFG). Shift opens the
# inventory, Right six times and Down three times go to the clover, and
# Return uses it after the inventory has been open some 8 seconds: its
# picture shows over the scene. In LBA.EXE the picture's end is set by
# the clock the inventory held, so that it shows for the time the
# inventory was open and 3 seconds more, some 11 seconds. Set by the
# clock given back, it shows for 3.
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 12
shot start
key Shift_L
sleep 2
key Right Right Right Right Right Right
sleep 1
key Down Down Down
sleep 5
shot inventory
key Return
sleep 2
shot used
sleep 3
shot after
sleep 6
shot end
